  "details": "My friend list never update, i need to restart the game to see updates. \nI have around 526 friends, but usually around 30-60 online.\nIn logs i can see some suspicious error:\n```\n2020.10.29 22:29:13 Error      -  [All] Exception handling Finished: Index was outside the bounds of the array.\n  at VRC.Core.APIUser+<>c__DisplayClass206_0.<FetchGroupNames>b__0 (VRC.Core.ApiContainer c) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at VRC.Core.APIResponseHandler.HandleResponse (System.Int32 requestId, BestHTTP.HTTPRequest req, BestHTTP.HTTPResponse resp, VRC.Core.ApiContainer responseContainer, System.Int32 retryCount, System.Boolean useCache) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at VRC.Core.API+<>c__DisplayClass34_4.<SendRequestInternal>b__4 (BestHTTP.HTTPRequest req, BestHTTP.HTTPResponse resp) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at VRC.SDKBase.VRC_AnimatorLayerControl+ApplySettingsDelegate.Invoke (VRC.SDKBase.VRC_AnimatorLayerControl control, UnityEngine.Animator animator) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at BestHTTP.HTTPRequest.CallCallback () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at BestHTTP.ConnectionBase.HandleCallback () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n  at BestHTTP.HTTPManager.OnUpdate () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n2020.10.29 22:29:13 Log        -  [API] \nBad response data.\n2020.10.29 22:29:13 Error      -  Could not fetch users groups - Bad response data.\n```\nAlso I have quite a bit of friend requests, if maybe that can affect anything.\nGame is just unplayable like that...",
